  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reducing new HIV infections and HIV related mortality and morbidity among Somalis - Somalia (01-Jul-2015-31-Dec-2017)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Somalia, HIV, United Nations Children&apos;s Fund (UNICEF)This program has the following goals: Reduce mortality among men, women and children living with HIV by 30% by 2019.  Reduce new infections by 30% by 2019. The objectives of this program are: Ensure an enabling environment for the response.  Increase access to and utilization of optimally efficient, effective and integrated treatment, care and support services.  Prevent new HIV infections especially especially among key populations such as sex workers and their clients through combination HIV prevention interventions.  Strengthen management and coordination of the response.  Strengthen monitoring and evaluation of the response</narrative>
  </description>
